bbf8\uc158\uc5d0 \ub3c4\uc804\ud574 \uc8fc\uc138\uc694.\n\ud589\uc6b4\uc744 \ube55\ub2c8\ub2e4.", "short_description": "\uacf5\uaca9\uc5d0 \ub9de\uc11c \uc228\uaca8\uc9c4 \ubc31\uc2e0\uc744 \ucc3e\uc544 \ubb34\uc0ac\ud788 \ud0c8\ucd9c\ud558\uc138\uc694.\n\uc2dc\uac04\uc774 \uc5bc\ub9c8 \ub0a8\uc9c0 \uc54a\uc558\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4. \uc784\ubb34\uc5d0 \ub3c4\uc804\ud574 \uc8fc\uc138\uc694.\n\ud589\uc6b4\uc744 \ube55\ub2c8\ub2e4."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1440.png", "id": "5326826874014845", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974686_5326826877348178_4410480538991530305_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=eqS4iLSemsIQ7kNvwGBtjvl&_nc_oc=Adnko_O_ikB2B1Thw8g45OA3WMp2FZq1khwVu3XfZsRRt6JAyKzftAXGW5lhQ879W30&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuxV59DobCSFsL97xQwBYI98yxZQfry5e0ZednU_R-24g&oe=69A42B84"}, {"file_name": "2500.png", "id": "3354176981483217", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974570_3354176984816550_8804543052629835219_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=AzrxpzcbkEwQ7kNvwHxIvTh&_nc_oc=Adn7mjlyIqL1GPe4jMtlPOBeTs1V-VzFCOIACMR5FvhG1Fx7q2qquiW8OEVakRFCl_I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afswm7gkd1g6CP5s7M-QA4XyUOz-iYnW4AP4IkeQdzcfrA&oe=69A439B5"}, {"file_name": "2560_fix.png", "id": "1088557028600010", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031495_1088557031933343_7274856899389536195_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VbL1p-xqNM4Q7kNvwGzyakw&_nc_oc=AdncxM_sqFPhStx-wiNMp3iegbqpsDJ9met_PkZscIt-GPaz7LBsWhs6svL20psaP84&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftI49a7gZcZKxv2UhnpPF3UorRtVAUFFmebMhEXKFAzgA&oe=69A41CA4"}, {"file_name": "3000.png", "id": "1068641280660114", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036605_106864128